1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
SybilShield turns a social handle into a staked credential passport.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
The passport is reviewed by validators, not by a backend opinion.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Free vouches and copied proof pages make reputation trivially farmable.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Sybil clusters recycle one identity across many wallets.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Applicants lock real SST. Peers vouch with real stake.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
A challenger locks a bond equal to the stake before verification.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Validators fetch the proof page and must agree on three fields.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Anchor 0 slashes. 40 stays provisional. 75 verifies. 100 is Diamond.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Every liability stays in vault custody until settlement is claimed.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Rewards are paid only from slashed fraud, never minted per verification.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Live on studionet: 19 finalized transactions and 3 guard rollbacks.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Four way sha256 match. github.com/hoveiser/sybil-shield

